-89b7a01b73e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=57b209d7610296edf851a5a5820624e5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/895c98c6/uploads/origins/eec1c4f4-77f2-4059-9346-89b7a01b73e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e716c564c9697d77d3cc0da0d045cb1e 3x"}, "body": "日頃お世話になっております！\nSDSkeb開設されたとお聞きしていたので、リクエスト送らせていただきました。\n\nもしよろしければ、OCのアサドを描いていただきたいです。\n細かな指定はないので自由に描いてもらえると嬉しいです！\nご検討よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Pjhp37GZubRVhJ1TsVfyUHzYaAPslgKB?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Hoshimori/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3667723, "client_id": 3765040, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/372cb2f6/uploads/origins/e5cc4f4e-f837-4ad9-93cf-ec6bd4274805?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5143a0502e6fc56702ecc57aded959fc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/372cb2f6/uploads/origins/e5cc4f4e-f837-4ad9-93cf-ec6bd4274805?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5143a0502e6fc56702ecc57aded959fc, https://si.imgix.net/372cb2f6/uploads/origins/e5cc4f4e-f837-4ad9-93cf-ec6bd4274805?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0af4d37b7062866ec3582842c64c947 2x, https://si.imgix.net/372cb2f6/uploads/origins/e5cc4f4e-f837-4ad9-93cf-ec6bd4274805?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e9de9f69ef4adb07c38fdc8390100e9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/372cb2f6/uploads/origins/e5cc4f4e-f837-4ad9-93cf-ec6bd4274805?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=233b76ad117e7797237c9730a5fc41a8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/372cb2f6/uploads/origins/e5cc4f4e-f837-4ad9-93cf-ec6bd4274805?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=233b76ad117e7797237c9730a5fc41a8, https://si.imgix.net/372cb2f6/uploads/origins/e5cc4f4e-f837-4ad9-93cf-ec6bd4274805?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=63853f9aefc1edfaedc174ec8e954413 2x, https://si.imgix.net/372cb2f6/uploads/origins/e5cc4f4e-f837-4ad9-93cf-ec6bd4274805?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0563c13a38027ae0c11415398ed7e429 3x"}, "body": "こんにちはYamai先生、\n\nMy name is Mizu. I saw your art on twitter recently and loved your art\t(ﾉ◕ヮ◕)ﾉ*:･ﾟ✧ \nI like your designs and really want to get my VTUBER OC in your fantasy style! \n\nMy VTUBER OC likes horror movies, swimming and Takoyaki.  He is also tired and sleepy all the time. He also loves the rain. He likes the full moon. He is passionate, flirty and aloof. For weapons, you can pick whichever you think would suit him!  \n\nFeel free to chose the pose and add any accessories that you want! Please keep the ears and tail. Also please try to keep the skin color the same.\n\nHere is the link to the reference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TjezNcGnrmFHs92gZ-0-09uwnMZhi8XE?usp=sharing\n\nThank you for your time („• ᴗ •„)", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Hoshimori/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3667723, "client_id": 2371476, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6fb3bea5/uploads/origins/157f923c-820e-420c-8011-ef6870b0e5b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58a70450e6493c04493e6c6a303a9c78", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6fb3bea5/uploads/origins/157f923c-820e-420c-8011-ef6870b0e5b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=cr